                                                "sense_id": "7bbe1478-4196-3f7b-b0ab-3f896e70e972",
                                                "text": "A group of anti-Park farmers who tried to drive into the capital on tractors and trucks had skirmishes with police overnight in Suwon, just south of the capital, Seoul."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d41fd39-4e19-4e67-82a0-1e99abefebf1",
                                                "sense_id": "7bbe1478-4196-3f7b-b0ab-3f896e70e972",
                                                "text": "Park Jeong-jae, a district court judge in Suwon, south of Seoul, said on Thursday in his ruling on Mr. Yoon’s case, “It was a wrong verdict based on faulty investigations.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
